                "metadata": {
                    "category": "music",
                    "audioPreviewUrl": "https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/0ddefd1ab364f91fae2f2e819d96cce873b4b8b1553133102f4e0b77e014140a/01M_eWSgyesp1W_ULci-EPJYqgH76cPeFpv4AF6WVHs.mp3",
                    "description": "Reunite with Moana and Maui for an expansive new voyage alongside a crew of unlikely seafarers. After receiving an unexpected call from her wayfinding ancestors, Moana must journey to the far seas of Oceania and into dangerous, long-lost waters for an adventure unlike anything she’s ever faced.   \n\nMoana 2 builds on the original film’s extraordinary music affinity, building an entirely new musical chapter in Moana’s story as she embarks on a journey like never before. The soundtrack features original songs from Abigail Barlow and Emily Bear, as well as transformative score from composer Mark Mancina and Tokelauan singer-songwriter Opetaia Foa'i.",
